pseudocode:
for all 1≤i≤j≤n: e[i,j] ← leastSquaresSSE(points i..j)
M[0] ← 0
for j=1..n:
   M[j] ← min over i=1..j of M[i−1]+e[i,j]+C
   prev[j] ← minimizing i
trace backward from j=n via prev to recover segments

OPT(i,j) ← 0 for j−i<5 or empty interval
for span=5..n−1:
  for i with j=i+span<n:
    OPT(i,j) ← OPT(i,j−1)
    for t=i..j−5:
      if compatible(base[t],base[j]):
        OPT(i,j) ← max(OPT(i,j), 1+OPT(i,t−1)+OPT(t+1,j−1))
return OPT(0,n−1) and its noncrossing traceback

Pplus ← sum(max(0,p[i]) for all projects)
for i with p[i]>0: addEdge(source,i,p[i])
for i with p[i]<0: addEdge(i,sink,−p[i])
for each prerequisite i→j: addEdge(i,j,Pplus+1)
compute min s−t cut (S,T)
return selected=S−{source}, netValue=Pplus−cutCapacity
